  p
    | The paper "
    a.external(href="https://puma.hpi.de/bibtex/28d30f89f9878be9ddbcd4772e314ae54" target="_blank") FERMIUM: A Framework for Real-time Procedural Point Cloud Animation and Morphing
    | " by Ole Wegen, Florence Böttger, Jürgen Döllner, and Matthias Trapp was accepted for publication and presentation at the
    a.external(href="https://vmv2021.inf.tu-dresden.de" target="_blank")  26th International Symposium on Vision, Modeling, and Visualization (VMV 2021)
    | . The symposium will take place as virtual-only event September 27-28, 2021 at the Faculty of Computer Science of the Technische Universität Dresden, Germany.
